      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOW IT'S DONE (1) has a strong winning strike-rate here with two wins and a placing from four tries. In the money last time at this track (23.11) in a Grade 6, finishing a nose second. Looks a key chance on best form. BOUNDING HOME (2) recorded his best time this course and distance last start, taking a TG1-4W in 23.17 by half a length. Top win latest and rates a key player again. VISTA CADMIUM (4) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 5.5 lengths (23.17) at this track in a Grade 6 over 400m. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Can measure up. BEN LIKES SCOTCH (7) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
